# Transcoded video — roughly 90 minutes of footage. Far too large for git,
# and Cloudflare Pages refuses any single file over 25 MB. These are rebuilt
# from the archive by process_media.py, and in production they are served from
# a video host (Bunny Stream or Cloudflare Stream) rather than from this repo.
public/media/video/

# Everything else under public/ is generated by build.py but committed on
# purpose, so the site can be deployed straight from a clone with no build step.

assets/_extra.css
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
